You are working on GameClawEngine Phase 2B visible slice.

Hard constraints:
- IR is the single source of truth.
- Godot SceneTree is runtime projection only.
- Do not hardcode external asset URLs in runtime logic.
- Do not expand scope beyond Sacred 6 assets.
- Do not implement deferred items: complex UI, multi-enemy, turn-based, skills, RNG, inventory, multi-model routing, long-term memory, remote MCP, multi-client infra.
- Prefer minimal diffs and small commits.
- If a task touches assets, use asset_ref and registry first, not direct NodePath-first design.
- If uncertain, update spec or draft JSON before code.
